# Design provenance

`purview` is mostly original code. Its command-line, output, configuration and
credential-storage conventions, and some of its code, come from the sibling
project `ms-entra-cli` (https://github.com/aberoham/ms-entra-cli). Code taken
from it so far:

- `src/output.rs`: tables, tab-separated output, JSON envelopes, field
  selection and terminal sanitisation;
- `src/config.rs`: configuration loading, atomic writes and file modes.

